# replies.pdl - what the pet says after it does something. REPLY | verb | mood | text. mood is happy or sad (from the happy meter). The pet only SPEAKS words the master taught it
# (lexicon); these are its fixed reactions. Add rows to give it more to say. The master teaches words with: pet_event.sh teach "<phrase>" <verb> [item]
REPLY | feed   | happy | yum yum!
REPLY | feed   | sad   | ...thanks
REPLY | sleep  | happy | zzz... nice
REPLY | sleep  | sad   | zzz
REPLY | wash   | happy | splash! so clean
REPLY | wash   | sad   | brr
REPLY | play   | happy | wheee!
REPLY | play   | sad   | ok...
REPLY | touch  | happy | hehe!
REPLY | touch  | sad   | hm?
REPLY | unknown| happy | ? (teach me: say what it means)
REPLY | unknown| sad   | ?
REPLY | hello  | happy | hi master!
REPLY | hello  | sad   | hi...
